  "ufc": {
    "sport": "ufc",
    "name": "Youth Over Experience",
    "rule": "At 155 lbs and below (incl. all women's divisions), bet the moneyline FAVORITE when that fighter is 5+ years younger than the opponent.",
    "why": "Speed and reaction time decline fastest in the lighter divisions, and the market prices record and name value more heavily than age. Younger favorites win more often than their price implies. Young underdogs show no edge, so this is mispricing at the top of the market, not a general 'youth' effect.",
